Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, after spending some\Ntime behind these stone walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to realize how\Nfoolish I was in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My desire to steal consumed me,\Nand from there I lost all control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am deeply ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, may I please have your\Nassistance in receiving early parole?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Recent studies show that if they\Nreceive the proper training,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,animals such as dogs and parrots\Ncan learn to read, use fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and even appreciate art.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.36,0:00:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's truly the case, then what's the\Ndifference between humans and animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I don't see how\Nthat relates to my...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.79,0:01:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever tried this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.66,0:01:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The challenge comes after completing the\Nfirst cherry with it still in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now which tooth must you\Nuse to bite into the second?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you accidentally\Nbit the first seed that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you went through the\Ntrouble of completing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.32,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, sorry, Father,\Nbut about my parole?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there is a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean it, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be sure to put in a good\Nword for you with the committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.98,0:01:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.44,0:01:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have taken a liking to\Nthose mischievous hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ill-natured self will never be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.72,0:01:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I cannot ignore the\Ntalents you possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:01:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They will be of much use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,By no means can Jotaro\NStan leave this prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so I will leave the task\Nof preventing that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to say no time, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Can we find a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,5, 4, 3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming low
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,time I don't stop beating,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,don't stop beating, don't\Nstop beating, I'm up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell do you mean you had\NFF hide it somewhere for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,After all that effort it took to get\Nit, it's got your dad's stand on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even know where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, they're still in...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to the swamp, it's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We should do what\Nthey're doing over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's called playing catch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I trust FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And as far as we know, Pale Snake\Nhas no clue our new friend's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safer this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But look at it like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't it be even better to send\Nit to the people holding your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It would.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to escape so my phone\Nand visitor privileges are gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and I still haven't come up\Nwith a plan to carry it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you fugly ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that out of your mouth now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I replenish my thirst\Nand you hurl insults?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the cup down now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're on the bench where\Nyou found it, immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's that important to you, you\Nshouldn't leave it sitting around,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,especially in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ignore her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go get you more water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, FF, don't make a scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it here! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's actually more here now. Lucky me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's throw the ball around, yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never thrown a ball, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, pull your hips back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go, looking good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.78,0:06:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gone back and\Nforth 86 times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't dropped it once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Think we'll hit a hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred dollars says you won't. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you take that bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Mirashon, and\NFE26789 is my prisoner number.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying you won't catch the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to bet a hundred dollars!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that your little game of catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,will end before you reach a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think this is\Ncoming out of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you really want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trying to kill time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only 13 more passes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, not another word, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.29,0:06:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have anywhere near that amount of\Nmoney on me, so it won't be much of a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't have\Nto be money, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take drugs, cigarettes, chewing gum,\Nsome phone time, hell, even a vibrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything with a bit of value will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:06:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be frank with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really do bets, so get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go along with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some crazy luck, and\Nwhatever you don't have, I'll lend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,FF sucks at throwing, but they've\Nmanaged to do it 87 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it might be a trap\Nset by Palesnake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know that Mira shown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the same floor together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a stupid gambler that ruined\Nher life committing small robberies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're finally able to\Nuse the phones and get visits,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you're definitely going to wish you had\Nthis money to buy your place in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you in or are\Nyou not? Count me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do it for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can totally win!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but do you even have $100 on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll play,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but conditions are if you raise your voice\Nor move even one step from that spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the bet is called off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So the game has already begun then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won't be fair\Nif the distance is too
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,close or if you hold on\Nto the ball for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,More than three meters\Napart, within ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get this thing started!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just calm down before you throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got ten seconds, so take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And that makes 89.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's only 11 more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get those sticky fingers the\Nhell away from my water! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Way too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrate, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.32,0:08:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the problem here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she doing near my water?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.24,0:08:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just spectating quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do it away from my cup or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Clock's ticking. Go,\NEphef! Throw the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's bugging me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold your water. Now throw the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw it! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close, but you pulled through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I panicked back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Be more careful next time, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a hundred times! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,With the way I'm feeling, a hundred\Nmore times sounds like a breeze, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an easy win like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fork over the hundred dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.15,0:09:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You were betting with FF\Nearlier, too, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So doesn't that mean it\Nshould be two hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.71,0:09:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It definitely should be two hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a grand on you not\Nbeing able to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you my bet is $1,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:09:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even have that kind of cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But like I said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,anything with value will\Ndo the trick just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules remain unchanged\Nas well. Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're done with your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We might have just won.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But honestly, I don't like you one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.38,0:10:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you want to bet,\Ntake it somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go instead of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, okay. Abs, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the bowling glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,On it! Irvis!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I don't like this\Nchick all that much either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.16,0:10:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the way she's oddly fixated on betting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, if it's going to be\N$1,200 including the earlier bet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way we can pass this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You might want to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the rules of the last game, this\None began the moment you decided to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've less than 10 seconds. Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's another easy victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,30!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,31!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,32!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Next we'll be a 33!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Put away the gear already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's exercise period is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,F's catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,33!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell's your damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna have ourselves\Na problem here, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're calling this bed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's a thought for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's suppose for a moment now that a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,meteorite fell from the\Nheavens out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it's wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'd probably think that the game\Nshould be called off, like it's just over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd say it's the Meteor's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And not to convince me,\Nmind you, but yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you sure that's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you two might\Nhave run out of exercise time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:12:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were taking your sweet time\Nand deliberately throwing the ball slowly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look into\Nyour heart and you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's telling you you didn't break\Nany rules, there's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,By all means, if you're innocent,\Nyou can stop the game at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, Armas!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Be prepared to be sent\Nto solitary confinement!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard, just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, three will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go make my rounds over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fs, now! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But a measly $100 will only go so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say it only covers the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking that\Nglove. Give it her! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But in case something like this might\Nhappen, I'd put a sticker on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm merely a spectator here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't move a muscle or even think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, though I can't\Nprove what she just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On the inside, Ermes knows\Nexactly what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no denying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bestie just broke one of the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know because the debt collector, Mary\NLynn Manson, has appeared before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, hey! Watch yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you hide it\Naway or what the item is,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes absolutely everything\Nand leaves nothing behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticker!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you sold this liver I'm\Nholding on the Black Market,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It would make up for the\Nremaining $590 that you owe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Piss off! Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the shadow that lies\Ndeep within Hermes' heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you cannot\Npossibly land an attack on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes has broken the\Nrules you established,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and has therefore lost the bet on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to collect the debt\Nweighing on her shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are there any other\Nprecious items she may have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, I can exchange this liver\Nfor something of equal value.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This bet still isn't over yet. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll catch the ball a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we succeed, you'll give\Nback everything you took from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And then just leave us\Nthe hell alone. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I'm sure you're\Naware of how this goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You must offer something of equal value.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With the rules set, the game has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Esa, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ermes, you're not the one at fault here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Miraschon is a stand user, there's\Na high chance that Palesnake is involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then they're\Naiming for my dad's disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.52,0:15:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the Collector is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Another reason not to take this bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You got dragged into this shit\Nfest because of my family drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you die for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But how the hell are we\Ngoing to pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking about a\Nthousand throws in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And that thing earlier\Nwas basically invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's exactly why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.66,0:16:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to chase down\NMiroshon and attack her directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That greedy stand of hers may be\Ninvincible, but her body is fair game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she's putting\Ndistance between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I saw her come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That door on the other side of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have left from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.05,0:16:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.24,0:16:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As I threw the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.81,0:16:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll probably hit your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:16:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the ball! That's great, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's just stay calm\Nand keep the ball moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is here? Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.06,0:17:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fighting a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a voice come from\Nsomewhere over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So I fired randomly in\Nthat general direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now nearing lockdown time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All prisoners must return\Nto their cells immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and remain standing until\Nthe roll call begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, the roll call\Nwill commence shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, she ran that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.66,0:18:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that I know you're a fellow\Nstand user, I won't need to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the money, and deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, it's all yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the only thing I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, I want to know who in\Nthis prison gave you stand power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Palesnake, right? Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me who they really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you got time to be playing dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All I wanted to do was go on parole!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.78,0:18:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,An elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,One that transports our meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Six seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it five?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:18:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Julian!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, FF, throw it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got eight more seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.02,0:19:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, Mirachon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking care of easy and convenient\Nfavors like this is nothing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Need anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Try catching the ball now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.88,0:20:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can't anymore, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This game of catch is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead, Jolyne Keicho!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mary Lynn Manson will always\Ncome to collect what is owed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where they may be hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you are unaware,\NMary Lynn will know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll take your\Nmost expensive organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And to cover the remainder, I'll\Ntake your most precious possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.20,0:20:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's stand disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As for where to find it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That psychotic brat FF has had it\Nbehind them since the very beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've got your organ and your disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It all belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This little game of\Ncatch is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.16,0:20:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.26,0:21:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheater no, I never actually specified\Nthe person I'd be playing catch with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard counts too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.36,0:21:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like the collector also improves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.46,0:21:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we have 800 more\Nballs to catch or was it 900?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what? Screw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.10,0:22:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get my dad's\Ndisc out of this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And that includes the one\NPalesnake's holding on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.70,0:22:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.74,0:22:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.10,0:22:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.50,0:22:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.94,0:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.14,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.62,0:24:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
